---
---

<section
  id="learning"
  class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 items-center gap-8 border-t border-border px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_auto]"
>
  <div>
    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-primary uppercase">
      Learn, share, improve
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Make the most of every plugin.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <p class="max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
    Start with a ready-made workflow, learn how plugin manifests work, then
    contribute your own reusable expertise for the team.
  </p>

  <a
    href="https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/agents/about-plugins"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noreferrer"
    class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-primary-foreground transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
  >
    Read the plugin guide &nearr;
  </a>
</section>

<section
  id="contribute"
  class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 px-6 pb-20"
>
  <div
    class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-secondary px-8 py-14 text-secondary-foreground sm:px-14"
  >
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-primary uppercase">
        Build with your colleagues
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
        Have a workflow that saves the team time?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        Package it as a Copilot plugin, add it to the catalog, and help the next
        team start from a stronger place.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/copilot-cli/customize-copilot/plugins-creating"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
        class="mt-7 inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-primary px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground"
      >
        Open contribution guide &nearr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <span
      class="hidden text-[9rem] leading-none font-thin text-primary/15 lg:block"
      aria-hidden="true">+</span
    >
  </div>
</section>
